  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": false,
  "description": "A real-time video streaming app built with Node.js, React.js, and Socket.IO. The server streams base64-encoded image frames over WebSockets, while the client renders them in the browser, demonstrating real-time communication, frame synchronization, video playback without traditional media formats",
